My last name is Savage.

00:38:34.395 --> 00:38:35.622
That is so savage.

00:38:35.689 --> 00:38:36.889
High quality brand.

00:38:37.549 --> 00:38:41.040
-Organic materials?
-Organic cotton, 100%.

00:38:41.114 --> 00:38:44.645
Some of it made in the USA, you're trying
to get all of it made in the USA.

00:38:44.712 --> 00:38:48.091
That's one of my goals.
Have everything made here in the US.

00:38:48.158 --> 00:38:50.043
Okay, Malcom, you're a legend, buddy.

00:38:50.110 --> 00:38:51.978
Thanks for that. Good times, buddy.

00:38:53.005 --> 00:38:54.598
Lucked out with Malcom.

00:38:54.665 --> 00:38:56.941
Now back in the center of the city.

00:38:57.008 --> 00:39:00.059
And this party is starting
with the players here.

00:39:01.086 --> 00:39:04.546
I guess they're going on the bus right now,
the Croatia players.

00:39:05.210 --> 00:39:06.890
-[jazz music]
-[crowd cheering]

00:39:26.930 --> 00:39:28.193
[music and cheering]

00:39:35.030 --> 00:39:36.273
Guys, it's awesome.

00:39:36.340 --> 00:39:40.212
Such a great feeling. So festive.
Everyone's fired up.

00:39:40.916 --> 00:39:41.832
Good energy.

00:39:42.350 --> 00:39:45.843
I flew in last night with the plan
of shooting the video tomorrow

00:39:46.471 --> 00:39:48.980
and then last night
I found out this was happening

00:39:49.054 --> 00:39:51.360
so I was like
I gotta shoot the video today.

00:39:51.964 --> 00:39:53.902
Capture this energy on the streets.

00:39:54.860 --> 00:39:56.323
[man] Two, zero.

00:39:57.273 --> 00:39:59.220
[Peter] That's the best picture ever.

00:39:59.971 --> 00:40:02.490
You guys want it up and down or sideways?

00:40:06.240 --> 00:40:08.924
All right, father and son out
trying to get tickets.

00:40:09.459 --> 00:40:10.912
-No luck, huh?
-No luck.

00:40:11.405 --> 00:40:12.478
Sold out.

00:40:12.545 --> 00:40:14.806
Hopefully we find something.
You never know.

00:40:14.873 --> 00:40:17.955
-Who you guys going for?
-I'm here for Croatia, how about you?

00:40:18.412 --> 00:40:21.696
I want Croatia to win but I just want
to watch any World Cup game.

00:40:22.120 --> 00:40:24.593
You just want to get into any cup game?
Oh, man.

00:40:28.360 --> 00:40:29.244
[tribal music]

00:40:40.440 --> 00:40:41.514
[crowd cheering]

00:40:55.090 --> 00:40:56.353
[cheering continues]

00:41:12.373 --> 00:41:13.963
[Peter] Full circle, guys.

00:41:14.030 --> 00:41:14.913
Philadelphia.

00:41:15.361 --> 00:41:17.649
Not an easy place to define

00:41:18.247 --> 00:41:22.255
but such a beautiful interesting vibrant

00:41:22.833 --> 00:41:25.211
delicious, sad,

00:41:25.972 --> 00:41:26.855
gritty…

00:41:26.920 --> 00:41:30.840
And we did even see 97% of it today.

00:41:30.907 --> 00:41:33.493
I did my best
to show you as much as possible.

00:41:33.560 --> 00:41:35.101
Starting point of our

00:41:35.849 --> 00:41:38.668
beautiful and amazing country.

00:41:38.735 --> 00:41:42.118
If you're watching the day
this video drops on the fourth

00:41:42.729 --> 00:41:44.711
happy birthday fellow Americans.

00:41:45.194 --> 00:41:46.874
It's our birthday as a country.

00:41:47.367 --> 00:41:49.986
Such a spectacular experiment.

00:41:50.711 --> 00:41:52.395
Something so wild and different.

00:41:53.294 --> 00:41:54.842
And we've endured 250.

00:41:55.768 --> 00:41:58.259
To many, many more.

00:41:58.698 --> 00:42:00.527
Thanks for coming along on that journey.

00:42:00.594 --> 00:42:01.794
Until the next one.

00:42:03.757 --> 00:42:04.705
[drums playing]

